      "body": "addresses #47505\n\nelastic-ep joiners cannot enter the startup `world_group` endpoint all-gather because serving ranks already completed it during cluster startup and never re-enter it. this skips the collective and returns an empty list when `is_ep_joiner` is set, avoiding hangs on scale/recover joiners.\n\nadded unit test verifying `world_group.all_gather_object` is skipped when `is_ep_joiner=True`.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #41114845400](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41114845400)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #41114845150](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41114845150)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #41114844941](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41114844941)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
